# Layer 5 (CR 613.1e), SetColor$ read by block legality. Jhessian Zombies has
# Fear: it can't be blocked except by artifact and/or black creatures. Grizzly
# Bears is green, so on its own it could not block. Darkest Hour's
# S:Mode$ Continuous | Affected$ Creature | SetColor$ Black makes every creature
# black, so the declaration queue blocks 2=1 is legal and the Bears (2/2) take
# 2 damage from the Zombies (2/4) and die once the state-based actions run (the
# trailing advance); the Zombies survive.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 2=1
declareblockers
advance
firststrikedamage
advance
combatdamage
advance
